sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Dev as Developer or CI
    participant Kube as Kubernetes API
    participant Cron as retention-job CronJob
    participant Job as retention-job-smoke Job
    participant Pod as retention-job Pod
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    Note over Dev, Cron: CronJob은 baseline에서 suspend=true로 유지
    Dev->>Kube: kubectl get cronjob retention-job
    Kube-->>Dev: CronJob template 확인

    Note over Dev, Pod: 수동 smoke는 CronJob template을 one-shot Job으로 실행
    Dev->>Kube: delete job retention-job-smoke --ignore-not-found
    Dev->>Kube: create job retention-job-smoke<br/>--from=cronjob/retention-job
    Kube->>Job: Job 생성
    Job->>Pod: Pod 실행

    Pod->>PG: PurgeDeletedRooms(threshold)
    PG-->>Pod: purged room count
    Pod->>PG: PurgeDeletedUsers(threshold)
    PG-->>Pod: purged user count

    alt 성공
        Pod-->>Job: exit 0
        Job-->>Kube: Complete
        Kube-->>Dev: wait complete
    else 실패
        Pod-->>Job: exit non-zero
        Job-->>Kube: Failed
        Kube-->>Dev: describe job + logs 출력
    end

    Note over Dev, PG: 실제 schedule/concurrency/backoff 정책은 Phase 3 운영성 검증에서 결정
